+# OWNER DIRECTION
+
+The Owner wants Throne to live on the laptop and to be used over SSH only inside the local network. Throne is more than a GitHub backup. It is the future place of life for IMPERIUM truth, while PC remains the active IDE/WARP/execution surface.
+
+Near term:
+- Before Custodes exists, Servitor commits/pushes to GitHub and the system also asks Throne to export a latest commit bundle.
+- GitHub link may still be checked, but GitHub 404 must not create fake green.
+- Throne bundle should become authoritative review evidence when web links fail.
+
+Future:
+- Custodes will introduce a supervised admission zone for candidate commits.
+- Dirty candidates will be rejected and reported to Owner, Logos, Inquisition, and Speculum.
+- The system will learn to tell Servitor exactly what is wrong and demand corrected output.
